# X / Twitter rules for Shadowrocket RULE-SET
# Bind this list to the Japan policy in the main config:
# RULE-SET,<URL>,日本

# X main domains
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twitter.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twimg.com

# API, authentication and uploads
