DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.twitter.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oauth.twitter.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,upload.twitter.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,upload.x.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,platform.twitter.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,platform.x.com

# Images, video and media
